{"doc": "82253245_3247", "pairs": [["TO:", "K. A. Sparrow"], ["FROM:", "R. E. Lane"], ["JUNE 30", "X"], ["SUBJECT:", "STYLE LOW PRICE - PROGRESS REPORT"], ["PRE-SELL", "Overall pre-sell efforts were successful. Retail accounts that previously stocked Style Full Price accepted the introduction of the low price."], ["BIGIF / 2 FOR 1:", "Proved to be an excellent tool for pulling the balance of Style Full Price packs through the system. This aided the field greatly during the transition."], ["$7.00 CARTON COUPON/BUYDOWN:", "Effective in those retail calls that we could not exchange product out of. Those situations were limited."], ["NAME OF ACCOUNT", "M. Maskos & Sons"], ["NAME OF ACCOUNT", "Pollock Candy and Cigar"], ["NAME OF ACCOUNT", "McKeesport Candy Co."], ["NAME OF ACCOUNT", "Sico Serve"], ["IND/LOR VOLUME", "104/22"], ["NO. OF STORES", "18"], ["NAME OF ACCOUNT", "Sheetz"], ["IND/LOR VOLUME", "521/42"], ["NO. OF STORES", "150"], ["NAME OF ACCOUNT", "Thrift/Eckerd"], ["IND/LOR VOLUME", "137/20"], ["NO. OF STORES", "183"], ["NAME OF ACCOUNT", "Kroger"], ["NO. OF STORES", "21"], ["NAME OF ACCOUNT", "Rich Oil"], ["NO. OF STORES", "82"], ["NAME OF ACCOUNT", "Super America"], ["NO. OF STORES", "106"], ["NAME OF ACCOUNT", "CVS"], ["NO. OF STORES", "87"], ["NAME OF ACCOUNT", "W H Smith"], ["NO. OF STORES", "5"], ["NAME OF ACCOUNT", "7-11 318 Zon"], ["NO. OF STORES", "23"], ["NAME OF ACCOUNT", "Dairy Marts"], ["NO. OF STORES", "35"], ["NAME OF ACCOUNT", "Widman Drugs"], ["NO. OF STORES", "43"]], "seconds": 221.458810266, "calls": 2, "failed": false, "error": "", "model_version": "gemini-3-flash-preview"}
